{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom, my name is Daniel. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I am absolutely livid. My bill is completely wrong again! I've been charged twice for the same service and I want this fixed now.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you've had this experience, and I understand how frustrating it is to see incorrect charges on your statement.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "It's just not enough to say sorry. If this doesn't get sorted, I'm switching to another provider immediately.",
    "tags": ["churn_signal"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I want to make sure we get this right for you. Let me look at your account. Can you confirm your name and address?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "My name is Fatima Reddy and I live at 121 MG Road.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I can see the duplicate charge here. It looks like a system error. I'll need to escalate this to our billing specialists to get it corrected.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I just want my money back. Can you have them fix it?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will raise a refund request for the wrong charge right now.",
    "tags": ["action:refund_request"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Fine. How long will it take?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Please keep in mind that the refund is subject to approval and typically takes 7-10 business days to appear in your account.",
    "tags": ["disclosure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Okay, that's fair. I appreciate you actually taking care of it quickly.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You're very welcome. I've also noted your phone number as 92620 50095 and your email as fatima.29@examplemail.com for the confirmation email.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Is there anything else I can help you with today? I've escalated the billing error to the specialists and requested the refund. Goodbye!",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
